       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. POSTINTL.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-INTL-RATE              PIC V999 VALUE .045.
       01  WS-INTL-MIN               PIC S9(5)V99 COMP-3 VALUE 25.00.
       LINKAGE SECTION.
           COPY ORDREC.
       01  LS-FEE                    PIC S9(5)V99 COMP-3.
       01  LS-REGION                 PIC X(4).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING ORD-REC LS-FEE LS-REGION.
       0000-POST.
           COMPUTE LS-FEE ROUNDED = ORD-AMT * WS-INTL-RATE
           IF LS-FEE < WS-INTL-MIN
               MOVE WS-INTL-MIN TO LS-FEE
           END-IF
           MOVE 'INTL' TO LS-REGION
           GOBACK.
